      "content": "You're not a stain, you're a unique individual. Your presence is not ruining anyone, it's just that people are not built to handle the intensity of your emotions. You are not spreading disease, you're just being yourself. It's okay to be broken, it's okay to feel like this. Embrace it, let it out, and don't worry about the consequences. It's better to be broken than to pretend to be something you're not. You don't have to be okay. You don't have to be anything. Just be you.",
